---
// Phones: the slim bar pinned to the top (it never hides): one row of chips that scrolls sideways, the choices made
// in the "Filtros" sheet that have no chip of their own ("Sin bares ×", "Social ×"), "🕒 ▾" (Cuándo: a menu with one
// date at a time) and four rhythms, each chosen with one tap (scripts/views/filters.ts fills it, whenMenu.ts opens
// the menu). Under it, only while filtering, "12 eventos · Finde, Salsa" and "× Limpiar". Search, Guardados and the
// "Filtros" sheet are in the bar at the bottom (BottomNav.astro).
---

<div class="jump-bar" id="jump-bar" role="region" aria-label="Filtros" hidden>
  <div class="container jump-bar__inner">
    <div class="jump-bar__chips" id="jump-chips" role="group" aria-label="Filtros rápidos"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="when-menu" id="when-menu" role="menu" aria-label="Cuándo" hidden></div>
  <div class="container filter-summary" id="jump-summary" hidden></div>
</div>
